        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Raabta\" (song), Agent Vinod, Raabta, Heropanti, Dohchay\n- People: Saif Ali Khan, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Deepika Padukone, Sushant Singh Rajput, Kriti Sanon, Jim Sarbh, Sabbir Khan, Naga Chaitanya, Brahmanandam, Ravi Babu, Pooja Ramachandran, Posani Krishna Murali\n- Concepts: Bollywood, Hindi songs, music videos, remix videos, Filmfare Award for Best Female Debut\n\nFacts:\n- \"Raabta\" is a romantic Hindi song from the 2012 Bollywood film Agent Vinod.\n- The music video for \"Raabta\" features Saif Ali Khan and Kareena Kapoor Khan.\n- The remix video for \"Raabta\" stars Deepika Padukone, Sushant Singh Rajput, Kriti Sanon, and Jim Sarbh from the film Raabta.\n- Kriti Sanon's first Bollywood film was Sabbir Khan's romantic action drama Heropanti.\n- Kriti Sanon won the Filmfare Award for Best Female Debut for Heropanti.\n- Dohchay features Naga Chaitanya and Kriti Sanon in the lead roles.\n- Dohchay also includes Brahmanandam, Ravi Babu, Pooja Ramachandran, and Posani Krishna Murali in important roles.",
